  Description: The prowess of Swordmasters past flows through you. When you Climb,
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Force Open], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.High
    Jump], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Long Jump], or Swim, you can spend
    a Mythic Point to make the check at mythic proficiency. The first time each day
    that you critically succeed on an Athletics check while Climbing, Forcing Open,
    High Jumping, Long Jumping, or Swimming, you regain a Mythic Point.
